{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-self-observability-slo","title":"可观测性平台的自监控与 SLO 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/observability-platform-governance/platform-self-observability-slo","wordCount":2477,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性平台的自监控与-slo-机制\">可观测性平台的自监控与 SLO 机制</h1><p>当一个跨境电商平台的支付、清关、物流三张链路图全部依赖同一套追踪与遥测平台时，这套平台本身就成了单点。平台沉默的那一刻——Collector 队列打满、存储写入失败、通知通道静默——值班工程师失去的不是「某个服务的数据」，而是<strong>所有服务的眼睛</strong>；更危险的是失效往往静默：数据没到，但没有报警，因为报警所依赖的正是没有到的数据。本文拆解平台如何监控自己，并把「平台是否可信」变成可计算的 SLO 契约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自监控（self-observability）分两层。<strong>数据平面</strong>是摄入与查询路径（Collector 接收/处理/导出、存储引擎读写），失效表现为「数据丢或慢」；<strong>控制平面</strong>是配置分发、成员关系、告警评估与通知，失效表现为「配置不生效或没人被通知」。二者的共同点是——<strong>不能用被监控的系统告警自己</strong>，否则最严重的一类故障（整个平台宕机）恰好无法被报警。OpenTelemetry Collector 把自监控做成了一等配置：全部落在 <code>service.telemetry</code> 之下，默认在 <code>127.0.0.1:8888/metrics</code> 暴露 Prometheus 指标、日志写 <code>stderr</code>、内部 trace 默认关闭，指标默认 <code>normal</code> 级别（见 <a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/internal-telemetry/\">OpenTelemetry Collector internal telemetry</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[外部探针/独立监控栈] --&gt;|抓取 8888/metrics| B[Collector 自监控指标]&#10;  A --&gt;|探测 13133/health| C[health_check 扩展]&#10;  B --&gt; D{判定}&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|队列压力/导出失败| E[数据平面告警]&#10;  D --&gt;|成员关系/配置哈希| F[控制平面告警]&#10;  E --&gt; G[平台 SLO 错误预算]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|燃烧率超阈| H[独立通知通道]\">graph TD\n  A[外部探针/独立监控栈] --&gt;|抓取 8888/metrics| B[Collector 自监控指标]\n  A --&gt;|探测 13133/health| C[health_check 扩展]\n  B --&gt; D{判定}\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|队列压力/导出失败| E[数据平面告警]\n  D --&gt;|成员关系/配置哈希| F[控制平面告警]\n  E --&gt; G[平台 SLO 错误预算]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|燃烧率超阈| H[独立通知通道]</pre><p>箭头方向是关键：<strong>监控平台的监控栈必须独立于平台自身</strong>。Grafana Mimir 的官方 runbook 通过 mixin 提供自监控告警（如 <code>MimirIngesterReachingSeriesLimit</code> 在达到 <code>max_series</code> 的 80% 时触发），但这些指标的存储与评估必须落在另一个集群（见 <a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/mimir/latest/manage/mimir-runbooks/\">Grafana Mimir runbooks</a>）。常见失效到可核验信号的映射如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失效类别</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>检测手段</th>\n<th>平面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>摄入失败</td>\n<td><code>otelcol_receiver_refused_spans</code></td>\n<td>指标速率</td>\n<td>数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导出失败</td>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans</code></td>\n<td>指标速率</td>\n<td>数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列饱和</td>\n<td><code>otelcol_exporter_queue_size</code> / <code>_capacity</code></td>\n<td>比值</td>\n<td>数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程崩溃</td>\n<td><code>otelcol_process_uptime</code> 归零</td>\n<td>重启检测</td>\n<td>数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置漂移</td>\n<td><code>cortex_runtime_config_hash</code> 不一致</td>\n<td>副本间比对</td>\n<td>控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警静默</td>\n<td>Alertmanager 状态复制失败</td>\n<td><code>cortex_alertmanager_state_replication_failed_total</code></td>\n<td>控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"collector-自监控指标-从-basic-到-detailed\">Collector 自监控指标：从 basic 到 detailed</h2><p>Collector 用 <code>service.telemetry.metrics.level</code> 控制粒度，取 <code>none</code> / <code>basic</code> / <code>normal</code> / <code>detailed</code>（默认 <code>normal</code>）。<code>basic</code> 给出接收、导出、队列三类核心计数器：<code>otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans</code>、<code>otelcol_receiver_refused_spans</code>、<code>otelcol_exporter_sent_spans</code>、<code>otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans</code>，以及 <code>otelcol_exporter_queue_size</code> / <code>otelcol_exporter_queue_capacity</code>；<code>normal</code> 追加 batch 处理器指标，<code>detailed</code> 再追加 HTTP/RPC 延迟与字节量直方图。这些指标可浓缩成一条<strong>守恒关系</strong>，任一时刻左右不等就说明有数据卡在管道里或被丢弃：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>accepted</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>sent</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>queued</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>dropped</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{accepted} = \\text{sent} + \\text{queued} + \\text{dropped}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sent</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queued</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dropped</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践中两个最值得盯的比值是队列充满度与拒绝率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>otelcol_exporter_queue_size</mtext><mtext>otelcol_exporter_queue_capacity</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>receivers_refused</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>receivers_accepted</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>receivers_refused</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{queue} = \\frac{\\text{otelcol\\_exporter\\_queue\\_size}}{\\text{otelcol\\_exporter\\_queue\\_capacity}}, \\qquad r_{refuse} = \\frac{\\Delta\\,\\text{receivers\\_refused}}{\\Delta\\,\\text{receivers\\_accepted} + \\Delta\\,\\text{receivers\\_refused}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otelcol_exporter_queue_capacity</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otelcol_exporter_queue_size</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">receivers_accepted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">receivers_refused</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">receivers_refused</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{queue} \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示导出端跟不上摄入端，队列即将溢出；之后 <code>otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_spans</code> 开始增长，说明数据已在被丢弃。这一组合是数据平面最灵敏的早期信号——比「用户报少数据」早数分钟到数十分钟。易错点：legacy 的 <code>service.telemetry.metrics.address</code> 自 Collector v0.123.0 起被忽略；日志默认开启采样，<code>WARN</code> 以上日志洪泛时也会被节流——排查时若发现日志「断层」，往往不是没产生而是被采样了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制平面与数据平面的健康探针\">控制平面与数据平面的健康探针</h2><p>指标之外，平台需要<strong>主动探针</strong>回答「进程还活着吗、能不能服务」。Collector 的 <code>health_check</code> 扩展（当前 alpha）暴露一个 HTTP 端点供 Kubernetes liveness/readiness 探测，默认 <code>localhost:13133</code>、路径 <code>/</code>；默认实现下 <code>Ready()</code> 返回 <code>200 OK</code>、<code>NotReady()</code> 返回 <code>503</code>。一个来自 Mimir 运维经验的重要细节是：<strong>liveness 与 readiness 必须区分</strong>——liveness 失败触发重启，readiness 失败只从负载均衡摘除。若把「依赖不可用」误配成 liveness，一次下游存储抖动会导致全部 Collector 同时重启，把局部降级放大成全局中断。官方文档同时警告 <code>check_collector_pipeline</code> 字段行为不符合预期、不建议使用（见 <a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/tree/main/extension/healthcheckextension\">health_check extension</a>）。</p>\n<p>控制平面的健康重点不同：不是「进程活不活」，而是「副本间状态是否一致」。Mimir 中 <code>memberlist_client_cluster_members_count</code> 的告警逻辑是<strong>把每个实例看到的成员数与响应的实例数比对</strong>（更多可能意味着两个集群被意外合并，更少则是配置或通信故障）；<code>cortex_runtime_config_hash</code> 不一致说明副本加载了不同的配置。这类问题不产生错误日志，却会让行为出现难复现的分歧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台-slo-的定义与错误预算\">平台 SLO 的定义与错误预算</h2><p>把平台当作一个对内部用户（业务线开发者与值班工程师）提供服务的系统，即可套用标准 SLO 方法。Google SRE Workbook 把 SLI 定义为**「好事件除以总事件」的比值**，错误预算即允许失败的部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SLI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>good events</mtext><mtext>total events</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Error Budget</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>total events</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SLI} = \\frac{\\text{good events}}{\\text{total events}}, \\qquad \\text{Error Budget} = (1 - \\text{SLO}) \\times \\text{total events}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total events</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">good events</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Error Budget</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total events</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对可观测性平台，最自然的 SLI 族是流水线型（pipeline）：<strong>新鲜度、正确性、覆盖度</strong>。100% 的 SLO 是错误的目标——Workbook 指出同时故障不可避免、依赖系统会失败、每多一个九成本更高而收益递减，且变更（头号故障源）将变得不可能；实践中摄入新鲜度 SLO 常设在 99%–99.9%。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台 SLI 类型</th>\n<th>规格示例</th>\n<th>测量实现</th>\n<th>建议目标区间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新鲜度</td>\n<td>合成 trace 60s 内可查询</td>\n<td>定时探针写入 + 查询回读</td>\n<td>99%–99.9%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>采样后 span 无静默丢失</td>\n<td>Collector sent 计数 vs 存储写入计数</td>\n<td>99.9%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询可用性</td>\n<td>查询 API 5xx 比例</td>\n<td>网关指标</td>\n<td>99.9%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警时效</td>\n<td>触发到通知送达 &lt; 5min</td>\n<td>合成告警端到端计时</td>\n<td>99%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意<strong>规格与实现必须分离</strong>：规格是用户关心的结果（「链路数据在 60 秒内可查」），实现是测量方式（合成探针、对比 Collector 计数与存储查询结果）。以 30 天窗口、每日 10 亿 span 估算，若完整性 SLO 为 99.9%，全月允许丢失约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条 span——这把「平台靠不靠得住」变成可消费的额度：上低采样率省成本，还是保预算拉满全量摄入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多窗口多燃烧率告警\">多窗口多燃烧率告警</h2><p>错误预算本身不报警，**燃烧率（burn rate）**才报警。它是「相对于 SLO，服务消耗错误预算的速度」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为 SLO 周期（30 天 = 720 小时）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Burn Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>observed error rate</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Budget Consumed</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Burn Rate</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>window</mtext></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Burn Rate} = \\frac{\\text{observed error rate}}{1 - \\text{SLO}}, \\qquad \\text{Budget Consumed} = \\frac{\\text{Burn Rate} \\times \\text{window}}{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Burn Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">observed error rate</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Budget Consumed</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Burn Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">window</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对 99.9% 的 SLO，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\text{SLO}=0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span>，于是「14.4×燃烧率」对应的错误率阈值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14.4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.001</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.44</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14.4 \\times 0.001 = 1.44\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.44%</span></span></span></span></span>。Workbook 给出的是<strong>多窗口多燃烧率</strong>方案：同时用长窗口和短窗口（短窗口取长窗口的 1/12），两个窗口都超阈才触发，从而既快速发现又快速恢复，避免单个毛刺造成误报。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>长窗口</th>\n<th>短窗口</th>\n<th>燃烧率</th>\n<th>错误率阈值</th>\n<th>消耗预算</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Page</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>14.4×</td>\n<td>1.44%</td>\n<td>2%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.0144</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{1h}&gt;0.0144</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0144</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.0144</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{5m}&gt;0.0144</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0144</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Page</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>6×</td>\n<td>0.60%</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.006</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{6h}&gt;0.006</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.006</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.006</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{30m}&gt;0.006</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.006</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ticket</td>\n<td>24 小时</td>\n<td>2 小时</td>\n<td>3×</td>\n<td>0.30%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.003</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{24h}&gt;0.003</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.003</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.003</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{2h}&gt;0.003</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.003</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ticket</td>\n<td>3 天</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>0.10%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{3d}&gt;0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{6h}&gt;0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Page 级（1h/5m 或 6h/30m）覆盖「快烧」——大约 2%–5% 预算在数十分钟内被烧掉，两个窗口都越线时立即呼叫值班；Ticket 级（24h/2h 或 3d/6h）覆盖「慢烧」，典型场景是<strong>渐进式的摄入丢失</strong>：一周可能累计丢掉 3% 的数据却毫无单点异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"元监控-监控系统自身的盲区\">元监控：监控系统自身的盲区</h2><p>自监控最大的陷阱是<strong>监控栈与被监控对象共享命运</strong>。如果平台的告警规则跑在平台自己的查询引擎上、通知通道跑在平台自己的 Alertmanager 上，那么平台宕机时告警链路同步失效。Mimir 的 runbook 明确列出这类耦合点：Alertmanager 若有两个以上实例被 OOM kill，由于需要 quorum，API 操作会中断——尽管向外通知可能仍能成功。</p>\n<p>三条可核验的元监控原则：<strong>独立存储</strong>（平台自身的指标/日志/trace 写入一个独立、更小更简单的监控栈，它只需在平台全挂时还活着）；<strong>合成探针</strong>（定时写入一条已知 trace 再按 trace_id 回读，端到端验证摄入→存储→查询全链路，这是唯一同时覆盖数据平面与控制平面的信号）；<strong>通知通道冗余</strong>（平台 Page 告警至少有一条不经由平台自身组件的出口，如直连 PagerDuty）。遥测数据受本地化约束时，<strong>元监控栈也要按区域边界部署</strong>，否则跨区网络分区会让某区域的平台故障无法被本区域的独立监控发现——这与<a href=\"../telemetry-pipeline-storage-cost/telemetry-storage-query-engine\">遥测存储与查询引擎选型</a>中讨论的数据驻留约束是同一类问题的两个侧面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自监控分<strong>数据平面</strong>（摄入/导出/队列）与<strong>控制平面</strong>（成员关系/配置/通知）两层，失效模式与检测手段不同。</li>\n<li>Collector 自监控全在 <code>service.telemetry</code> 之下，<code>level</code> 取 <code>none</code>/<code>basic</code>/<code>normal</code>/<code>detailed</code>；守恒关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>accepted</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>sent</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>queued</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>dropped</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{accepted} = \\text{sent} + \\text{queued} + \\text{dropped}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sent</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">queued</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dropped</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与队列比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、拒绝率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{refuse}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最灵敏的第一性检查。</li>\n<li><code>health_check</code> 扩展默认暴露 <code>localhost:13133</code>；liveness 与 readiness 必须区分，避免依赖抖动引发全量重启。</li>\n<li>平台 SLO 采用流水线型 SLI（<strong>新鲜度、完整性、覆盖度</strong>），错误预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Budget</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>total</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Budget}=(1-\\text{SLO})\\times\\text{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Budget</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span>；SLI 先用最便宜的合成探针实现再迭代。</li>\n<li>告警采用<strong>多窗口多燃烧率</strong>：99.9% SLO 下 14.4×/6×/3×/1× 四档，短窗口取长窗口的 1/12，Page 与 Ticket 分级。</li>\n<li><strong>元监控栈必须独立且最小化</strong>，并按区域边界部署，配合成探针与冗余通知通道——否则平台宕机时报警链路同步失效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 的 <a href=\"../telemetry-pipeline-storage-cost/collector-pipeline-architecture\">采集管道架构</a>、<a href=\"../tracing-instrumentation-propagation/trace-context-propagation\">追踪上下文传播</a>。\n<em>来源：<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/internal-telemetry/\">OTel Collector internal telemetry</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/tree/main/extension/healthcheckextension\">health_check extension</a>、<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/implementing-slos/\">SRE Workbook</a>、<a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/mimir/latest/manage/mimir-runbooks/\">Grafana Mimir runbooks</a>。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测性平台的自监控与 SLO 机制","id":"可观测性平台的自监控与-slo-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Collector 自监控指标：从 basic 到 detailed","id":"collector-自监控指标-从-basic-到-detailed"},{"level":2,"text":"控制平面与数据平面的健康探针","id":"控制平面与数据平面的健康探针"},{"level":2,"text":"平台 SLO 的定义与错误预算","id":"平台-slo-的定义与错误预算"},{"level":2,"text":"多窗口多燃烧率告警","id":"多窗口多燃烧率告警"},{"level":2,"text":"元监控：监控系统自身的盲区","id":"元监控-监控系统自身的盲区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"遥测数据治理、PII 脱敏与合规保留模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/observability-platform-governance/telemetry-data-governance-model"},"next":{"title":"采集断链、丢数据与遥测平台应急实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/observability-platform-governance/telemetry-pipeline-incident-response"}}